1
00:00:00,604 --> 00:00:03,984
(Sheldon:)Look at Dr. Saul Perlmutter up there
clutching that Nobel Prize.

2
00:00:04,191 --> 00:00:06,821
(Sheldon:)What's the matter, Saul?
Afraid someone's gonna steal it?

3
00:00:07,027 --> 00:00:09,947
(Sheldon:)Like you stole Einstein's
cosmological constant?

4
00:00:11,823 --> 00:00:15,033
(Leonard:)You know what?
I am tired of living in fear of this guy.

5
00:00:15,702 --> 00:00:16,952
(Leonard:)I'm gonna go see him...

6
00:00:17,162 --> 00:00:19,792
...and say the things
I should have said in high school.

7
00:00:19,998 --> 00:00:21,748
"Pick on someone your own size."

8
00:00:21,959 --> 00:00:25,339
"No, you did not have sex
with my mother."

9
00:00:26,129 --> 00:00:29,509
And, "Yes, I do know
why I'm hitting myseIf."

10
00:00:30,133 --> 00:00:31,973
Oh. Now Perlmutter shaking
the king's hand.

11
00:00:32,177 --> 00:00:35,267
(Sheldon:)Yeah. Check for your watch,
Gustaf, he might've lifted it.

12
00:00:38,267 --> 00:00:39,687
(Bernadette:)I love this dress.

13
00:00:39,893 --> 00:00:43,563
(Bernadette:)- How come I never see you wear it?
- Because when I wear it, it's a shirt.

14
00:00:46,024 --> 00:00:47,904
(Penny:)So, what's Howard doing tonight?

15
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:50,650
(Bernadette:)Oh, they all went with Leonard
to confront his childhood bully.

16
00:00:50,862 --> 00:00:55,412
Oh. Terrific. High-school quarterback
against four mathletes.

17
00:00:56,285 --> 00:00:59,075
(Amy:)When Leonard gets back,
I'd love to check serotonin levels.

